================================================================================
Third-party code included in this repository
================================================================================

No third-party code is vendored here. Every dependency is declared and fetched
at build time, pinned to an exact version in:

  backend/pyproject.toml        (Python, exact pins)
  frontend/package-lock.json    (JavaScript)

Their licences are their own; nothing of them is copied into this repository.
An SBOM of a built image is produced with:

  trivy image --format cyclonedx -o sbom.json xenoproxy/backend:0.1.0

================================================================================
Fonts
================================================================================

The interface embeds two typefaces rather than fetching them from a CDN, so an
air-gapped deployment renders identically and no request leaves the browser:

  Inter            SIL Open Font License 1.1   https://rsms.me/inter/
  JetBrains Mono   SIL Open Font License 1.1   https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/mono/

Only the Latin subset of each is shipped, through the @fontsource-variable
packages listed in frontend/package.json.
